-- examples/checks/agg-join-delta-first-hole.rofl — A HOLE A NEGATION MEETS, UNDER A JOIN THE PLAN WOULD REORDER.
--
-- hx(y1, _) faults (oops + 1), so `not hx(Y, _)` is undecided for Y = y1 and the rule's
-- conclusion there is withdrawn: hit is holed (support_withdrawn) and inherits the shrug.
-- The negation records the body position it was met at and the bindings it was met with,
-- and the rest of the body is solved around them in written order (poison_solve). A
-- delta-first plan (engine/joinplan.rs) met it at another position with other bindings, and
-- the hole was lost; while an unknown spreads every firing is in written order
-- (agg_breaks `delta_first_spread`). Both engines.
-- expect-row: hole[$kernel]($rule(ra0d53dbb),support_withdrawn)
-- expect-row: shrug[$kernel]($rule(ra0d53dbb),inherited
edb(h). edb(l). edb(trig). edb(kk).
hx(Y, V) :- kk(Y, K), V is K + 1.
hit(Y, Z) :- h(X, Z), l(X, Y), trig(Y, Z), not hx(Y, _).
h(c, z1). l(c, y1).
h(c, z2). l(c, y2).
h(c, z3). l(c, y3).
h(c, z4). l(c, y4).
